1
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:02,080
In the afternoon,

2
00:01:02,410 --> 00:01:07,290
the farmer taught us how to cut branches and leaves from tomato plants.

3
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:10,090
This helps them to grow more fruit.

4
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:13,000
Finally, we watered the plants.

5
00:01:14,030 --> 00:01:16,060
Plants need so much work!

6
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:20,120
It was tiring, but I enjoyed working with my hands.

7
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:24,730
One thing I learnt today: Farming isn’t easy!

8
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:26,920
It made me think of the saying,

9
00:01:27,290 --> 00:01:29,710
“Every grain comes from hard work.”

10
00:01:30,090 --> 00:01:32,720
The farmer let us take some vegetables home.

11
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:35,200
My mum cooked some for dinner,

12
00:01:35,550 --> 00:01:37,720
and they were fresh and delicious!

13
00:01:38,250 --> 00:01:39,840
They certainly taste better

14
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,070
when you work for them!

15
00:01:41,550 --> 00:01:44,080
Today was really a day to remember

